---
import "./series-visual.css";
interface Props {
  variant: "regions" | "pipeline" | "diff";
}
const { variant } = Astro.props;
const regions = [
  {
    name: "对话区",
    content:
      "用户：修复求和函数，并运行测试。\n思考：先检查函数与测试……\n回答：我先查看求和函数。\n● read README.md ✓\n▸ 文件内容",
    description:
      "保存用户输入、模型回答、可见思考和已完成的工具结果。新内容追加，结果可以展开。",
    kind: "conversation",
  },
  {
    name: "活动区",
    content:
      "⠙ bash npm test · 3s\n⠹ reviewer · 检查修改 · 2 次工具调用 · read · 8s",
    description:
      "显示运行中的工具、子代理及耗时；等待时显示工作提示，结束后移除对应活动行。",
    kind: "activity",
  },
  {
    name: "排队提示",
    content: "1 queued\n  followUp: 修复后补充测试",
    description: "显示尚未处理的输入；队列为空时不占行。",
    kind: "queue",
  },
  {
    name: "输入区",
    content: "> 请保持函数接口不变▏",
    description: "保留正在编辑的文字与光标，响应键盘操作。",
    kind: "input",
  },
  {
    name: "底部状态栏",
    content: "模型 · 会话 · Token 用量 · 上下文占用",
    description: "显示当前配置和统计信息，数据变化后更新。",
    kind: "footer",
  },
];
---

<figure
  class="terminal-diagram series-visual not-prose"
  aria-labelledby={`terminal-${variant}-title`}
>
  {
    variant === "diff" ? (
      <>
        <p class="figure-title" id="terminal-diff-title">
          只有工具状态变化，这一帧怎样更新？
        </p>
        <div class="diff-frames">
          {[
            { title: "上一帧 · previousLines", time: "2s" },
            { title: "下一帧 · newLines", time: "3s" },
          ].map(frame => (
            <section class="diff-frame">
              <p class="diff-heading">{frame.title}</p>
              <p class="diff-line">
                <span class="line-number">1</span>
                <span>我正在检查测试。</span>
              </p>
              <p class="diff-line changed">
                <span class="line-number">2</span>
                <span>
                  bash npm test · <strong>{frame.time}</strong>
                </span>
              </p>
              <p class="diff-line">
                <span class="line-number">3</span>
                <span>
                  &gt; 请保持函数接口不变<span class="input-cursor">▏</span>
                </span>
              </p>
            </section>
          ))}
        </div>
        <p class="change-summary">
          变化范围：第 2 行。回答和输入文字保持不变。
        </p>
        <ol class="redraw-steps">
          <li>
            <>
              <strong>定位</strong>
              <span>光标从输入区移到第 2 行行首</span>
            </>
          </li>
          <li>
            <>
              <strong>清行</strong>
              <span>清除旧工具状态，避免残留字符</span>
            </>
          </li>
          <li>
            <>
              <strong>写入</strong>
              <span>写入 bash npm test · 3s</span>
            </>
          </li>
          <li>
            <>
              <strong>归位</strong>
              <span>把光标放回输入区的编辑位置</span>
            </>
          </li>
        </ol>
        <figcaption>
          教学示意：假设三行均在可见区域，仅耗时变化，省略颜色控制码、动画和输入边框。背景标出了要重绘的行。
        </figcaption>
      </>
    ) : variant === "regions" ? (
      <>
        <p class="figure-title" id="terminal-regions-title">
          imp 的终端界面：哪些区域会更新？
        </p>
        <div class="region-map">
          <div class="map-bar">imp · 终端区域示意</div>
          {regions.map(region => (
            <section class={`region-row ${region.kind}`}>
              <div class="region-content">
                <p class="region-label">{region.name}</p>
                <p class="sample">{region.content}</p>
              </div>
              <p class="region-description">{region.description}</p>
            </section>
          ))}
        </div>
        <figcaption>
          按主要区域示意布局，内容为教学示例；省略提问与快捷键提示。区域随内容增减高度，并非固定在屏幕的某一行。
        </figcaption>
      </>
    ) : (
      <>
        <p class="figure-title" id="terminal-pipeline-title">
          信息先更新显示状态，再统一写入终端
        </p>
        <div class="paths">
          <section>
            <>
              <p class="card-title">文字与完成结果</p>
              <p>运行事件 → Renderer</p>
              <p class="state">
                TranscriptSink
                <>
                  <br />
                  <span>保存显示记录和折叠内容</span>
                </>
              </p>
            </>
          </section>
          <section>
            <>
              <p class="card-title">当前活动与用户操作</p>
              <p>工具／子代理事件、定时器、键盘输入</p>
              <p class="state">
                活动区、编辑器等组件
                <>
                  <br />
                  <span>保存各自的显示状态</span>
                </>
              </p>
            </>
          </section>
        </div>
        <p class="arrow">↓ 内容变化后 requestRender()</p>
        <div class="engine">
          <>
            <strong>pi-tui：统一布局与刷新</strong>
            <p>组件生成显示行 → 比较前后两帧 → 确定重绘范围</p>
          </>
        </div>
        <p class="arrow">↓ 文字、样式与光标控制序列</p>
        <div class="terminal">
          <>
            <strong>终端</strong>
            <span>解释控制序列，更新屏幕内容与光标</span>
          </>
        </div>
        <figcaption>
          两条路径最终进入同一个
          TUI。模型返回内容与刷新计时器负责触发变化，终端库负责将这些变化画出来。
        </figcaption>
      </>
    )
  }
</figure>
<style>
  .terminal-diagram {
    margin: 1.8rem 0;
    color: var(--series-ink);
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    container-type: inline-size;
  }
  .figure-title {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .region-map {
    border: 1px solid var(--series-rule);
    border-radius: 0.6rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--series-paper);
  }
  .map-bar {
    padding: 0.7rem 1rem;
    background: var(--series-canvas);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--series-rule);
    color: var(--series-secondary);
  }
  .region-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.3fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--series-rule);
  }
  .region-row:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }
  .region-content {
    padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .region-label,
  .card-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 650;
  }
  .region-label {
    color: var(--series-blue);
  }
  .sample {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .region-description {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
    border-left: 1px dashed var(--series-rule);
    color: var(--series-secondary);
    align-content: center;
  }
  .activity {
    background: var(--series-blue-wash);
  }
  .input .sample {
    border-left: 2px solid var(--series-feedback);
    padding-left: 0.5rem;
  }
  .paths {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.8rem;
  }
  .paths section {
    padding: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--series-rule);
    border-radius: 0.55rem;
    background: var(--series-paper);
  }
  .paths p {
    margin: 0.6rem 0 0;
  }
  .state {
    padding: 0.7rem;
    background: var(--series-canvas);
    border: 1px solid var(--series-rule);
    border-radius: 0.3rem;
  }
  .state span {
    color: var(--series-secondary);
  }
  .arrow {
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0.7rem 0;
    color: var(--series-blue);
  }
  .engine,
  .terminal {
    border: 1px solid var(--series-blue);
    border-radius: 0.55rem;
    padding: 0.9rem;
    text-align: center;
    background: var(--series-blue-wash);
  }
  .engine p {
    margin: 0.4rem 0 0;
  }
  .terminal {
    border-color: var(--series-feedback);
    background: var(--series-paper);
  }
  .terminal span {
    display: block;
    color: var(--series-secondary);
  }
  figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--series-secondary);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
  }
  .diff-frames {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.8rem;
  }
  .diff-frame {
    min-width: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--series-rule);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--series-paper);
  }
  .diff-heading {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 650;
    background: var(--series-canvas);
  }
  .diff-line {
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 0.4rem;
    padding: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .line-number {
    color: var(--series-secondary);
  }
  .changed {
    background: var(--series-blue-wash);
    border-block: 1px solid var(--series-rule);
  }
  .changed strong {
    color: var(--series-blue);
  }
  .input-cursor {
    color: var(--series-feedback);
  }
  .change-summary {
    margin: 0.8rem 0;
    color: var(--series-blue);
  }
  .redraw-steps {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.5rem;
    counter-reset: step;
  }
  .redraw-steps li {
    border: 1px solid var(--series-rule);
    background: var(--series-paper);
    border-radius: 0.3rem;
    padding: 0.7rem;
    counter-increment: step;
  }
  .redraw-steps strong::before {
    content: counter(step) " · ";
    color: var(--series-blue);
  }
  .redraw-steps span {
    display: block;
    color: var(--series-secondary);
    margin-top: 0.2rem;
  }
  @container (max-width: 560px) {
    .diff-frames,
    .redraw-steps {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
    .region-row,
    .paths {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
    .region-description {
      border-left: 0;
      padding-top: 0;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
    }
  }
</style>
